# Legacy monolith rules

Single-project Worker Service under `src/legacy/TradingAssistant/TradingAssistant/`. **Maintenance only** — new features belong in Platform.

## Structure

- **Program.cs** — composition root: `AddBinance`, `AddDbContext`, `AddHostedService`, FASTER singleton.
- **BinanceService.cs** — Binance.Net REST/WebSocket; use `BinanceCredentials` (12.11+).
- **Strategies / handlers** — MediatR `INotificationHandler` / `IRequestHandler` in this assembly.
- **Workers / managers** — `BackgroundService` subclasses; register in `Program.cs`.
- **TradingContext** — EF Core SQLite; migrations in `Migrations/`.

## Conventions

- Keep changes minimal and localized — no new project layers.
- Prefer extending existing types over introducing abstractions unless porting to Platform.
- One public type per file; group by feature (`BinanceService.cs`, not `Services/BinanceService.cs`).
- When porting behavior to Platform, use [legacy-port-map.md](../../src/platform/TradingPlatform/docs/legacy-port-map.md).
